return {
    ["\n空的。那个大风车里面是空的。\n\n教堂的门也推不开。\n\n女神啊。如果我在做梦，请让我醒过来吧。"] = "\nEmpty. The inside of that big windmill is empty.\n\nI can't push open the church door either.\n\nEvernight Goddess. If I am dreaming, please let me wake up.",
