    ["1. 在部分副本中，队伍人数没有组满时可发布求援\n2. 成功完成他人的求援帮助可获得一定的绑定苏勒奖励\n3. 应援失败也会获得少量绑定苏勒奖励"] = "1. In some dungeons, if the team is not full, you can post a request for help. \n 2. Successfully helping others with their requests grants a certain amount of bound Gold Pounds. \n 3. Failing to provide support also grants a small amount of bound Gold Pounds.",
