    ["<Assistant_Title1>狒狒！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀普通难度舞王狒哥"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Baboon!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Dancing King Baboon Brother on Normal difficulty",
    ["<Highlight>源自第四纪的古战场历史投影</>，分为<Highlight>猎城战</>和<Highlight>高原战</>两大战场。虽然第四纪的四皇之战已淹没在历史中，但强大的能量依旧残留在那片古战场上，于特定时间整个战场将被短暂活化。\n\n<Highlight>战场资格</>将在每轮<Highlight>四方联赛第一场结束后21:20</>分配，系统将根据俱乐部综合实力，将各俱乐部分配至猎城战或高原战，届时请留意查收邮件。\n\n<Highlight>猎城战：</>获得资格的俱乐部可前往「以战养战-势力-猎城战」界面查看势力分配，提前组织备战。参与即可获取人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红及战场称号等丰厚馈赠。\n\n<Highlight>高原战：</>获得资格的俱乐部请关注战场报名时间，及时参与。亦可获取人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红及战场称号等馈赠。\n\n更多详细规则请前往「以战养战-势力」界面查看。"] = "<Highlight>Historical projection of the ancient battlefield from the Fourth Epoch</>, divided into two major battlefields: <Highlight>Hunting City Battle</> and <Highlight>Plateau Battle</>. Although the War of the Four Emperors of the Fourth Epoch has been submerged in history, powerful energy still remains on that ancient battlefield, and the entire battlefield will be briefly activated at specific times. \n\n<Highlight>Battlefield Eligibility</> will be allocated at 21:20 after the first match of each round of the <Highlight>Four-Way League</>. The system will allocate each club to the Hunting City Battle or Plateau Battle based on the club's comprehensive strength. Please pay attention to your mail. \n\n<Highlight>Hunting City Battle: </>Clubs that have obtained eligibility can go to the \"War-to-War - Faction - Hunting City Battle\" interface to view faction allocation and organize preparations in advance. Participating will grant generous rewards such as contact and marionette drawing items, Sul dividends, and battlefield titles. \n\n<Highlight>Plateau Battle: </>Clubs that have obtained eligibility should pay attention to the battlefield registration time and participate in time. You can also obtain rewards such as contact and marionette drawing items, Sul dividends, and battlefield titles. \n\nFor more detailed rules, please go to the \"War-to-War - Faction\" interface.",
